In addition to predicting active sequences from those generated using non-template-based sampling methods, the DBAASP database  [44] was searched for exact matches of the generated sequences. It was ensured that the generated sequences were not present in the training dataset and that only highly active AMPs annotated with a MIC value \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
