Additionally, the WAE reproduced the median of all the peptide descriptor distributions with the highest accuracy of all models. This is in line with the observation by Das et al.  [1], stating that the reconstructed sequences by the WAE were more diverse than those generated by a plain VAE. This observation should also hold for the template-free-generated sequences. Since, in contrast to VAEs, WAEs force the continuous mixture \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
